Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.64,0:02:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.77,0:03:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,the 42-inch CRT on the first floor
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.69,0:03:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,just happens to function as the lifter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.53,0:03:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So we were only able to send
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.78,0:03:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Mails when the studio was open and the TV was on...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.58,0:03:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes a lot of sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.08,0:03:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so loud. It hurts my head...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.79,0:03:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.08,0:03:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Braun...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.33,0:03:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought you'd resort to violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.38,0:03:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,In a way, it's your own fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.01,0:03:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who wanted to run an experiment!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.51,0:03:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we almost completely understand
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.89,0:03:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,how the PhoneWave works now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.01,0:03:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means that next...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.43,0:03:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,we should consider physically transporting an object through time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.89,0:03:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.73,0:03:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't dismiss it so quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.69,0:03:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going to end up jelly, no matter what we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.73,0:03:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And how, exactly, do you fit a human into 36 bytes...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.62,0:03:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this really the time for showing off?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.99,0:03:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I want to show off to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.24,0:03:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the title of my paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.87,0:04:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,"The Analysis of Nerve Pulse Signals
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.92,0:04:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Stored in Memory Within the Temporal Lobe."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.09,0:04:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I get that in a language I understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.05,0:04:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Essentially, it has to do with people's memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.97,0:04:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I majored in neuroscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.80,0:04:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Put simply,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.22,0:04:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,the brain stores memories as pulse signals.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.73,0:04:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They're a type of electrical data.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.60,0:04:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Data... You can't mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.23,0:04:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.48,0:04:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sending a human through time is impossible,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.86,0:04:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,but it might be possible to send their memory data.
