Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.34,0:04:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's more of a time leap than time travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.34,0:04:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.93,0:04:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,All the lines have converged at one point.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.68,0:04:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The plan will now enter its final stages.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.89,0:05:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The goddess who rules the present...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.31,0:05:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Begin Operation Verthandi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.65,0:05:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Begin what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.73,0:05:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain what you're talking about a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.02,0:05:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm saying we're going to do that time leap you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.82,0:05:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Begin now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.82,0:05:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But we'll need a lot of stuff to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.20,0:05:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, we only have to read memories stored in the temporal lobe,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.96,0:05:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,so I think I can get everything in Akiba...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.58,0:05:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.54,0:05:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.42,0:05:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,One problem is that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.80,0:05:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think the PhoneWave will be able
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.30,0:05:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,to sufficiently compress the memory data.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.85,0:05:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.01,0:05:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.64,0:05:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.85,0:05:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.85,0:05:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make a list of the parts I need for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.32,0:05:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too hard for Mayushii to understand it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.44,0:05:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Christina just explained it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.78,0:05:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You're sending your mind, as it exists right now, to the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.20,0:06:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.37,0:06:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the D-Mail not good enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.33,0:06:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,There are too many chaotic variables with the D-Mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.42,0:06:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,One message can change things you'd never expect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.01,0:06:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's okay to send memories into the past?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.76,0:06:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If nothing else, you can
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.35,0:06:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,prevent the past from changing to some degree.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.43,0:06:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't have the entire city of Akiba changing...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.73,0:06:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The city?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.61,0:06:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing. Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.65,0:06:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.61,0:06:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But what happens to you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.82,0:06:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,after you send your memories?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.74,0:06:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Your body's still here, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.33,0:06:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.41,0:06:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Mayushii is talking to Okarin now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.54,0:06:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, you're saying Mayushii goes back a week
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.63,0:06:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and then relives the week, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.59,0:06:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What happens if she doesn't talk to Okarin this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.93,0:07:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I assume that you would recall that we spoke,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.27,0:07:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,but the event{omgphysics} of having spoken would be erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.48,0:07:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, Mayushii would remember us talking,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.56,0:07:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,but Okarin wouldn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.15,0:07:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd imagine so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.78,0:07:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Then that's kind of sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.95,0:07:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,For me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.70,0:07:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.91,0:07:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,For Mayushii.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.79,0:07:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Moeka!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.79,0:07:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Moeka!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.35,0:07:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You look rather unhappy, Shining Finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.65,0:07:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,"Did you get rid of the time machine?"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.78,0:08:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We're still using it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.57,0:08:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, we might be able to do a time leap—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.91,0:08:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell her about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.41,0:08:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But Moeka's a lab mem, too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.25,0:08:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,She is, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.21,0:08:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,"What's a time leap?"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.38,0:08:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what it sounds like!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.05,0:08:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We can send memories through time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.84,0:08:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Memories...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.60,0:08:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Moeka?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.19,0:08:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Moeka!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.31,0:08:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.32,0:08:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be faster to head for Akibaoo{shop name} first, I guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.78,0:08:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.33,0:08:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Nae!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.83,0:08:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.04,0:08:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.75,0:08:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still dressed like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.13,0:08:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss told me to stay this way all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.55,0:09:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll poison children's minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.59,0:09:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.68,0:09:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm careful never to walk around with poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.18,0:09:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.22,0:09:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Nae said she wanted to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.47,0:09:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,talk to Okabe Rintaro, so we were looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.19,0:09:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,To me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.06,0:09:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.31,0:09:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My dad was really mean back there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.28,0:09:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Nae...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.57,0:09:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You came all this way to say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.70,0:09:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What a well-trained little pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.20,0:09:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not a pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.20,0:09:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.45,0:09:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I cause trouble for Mr. Braun all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.54,0:09:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We're even.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.25,0:09:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not like the Okabe Rintaro I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.84,0:09:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin's always like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.97,0:09:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii's gonna get going, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.09,0:09:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Meeting someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.05,0:09:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.72,0:09:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to give the cosplayer, Fubuki, her outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.72,0:09:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, it's almost time for ComiMa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.02,0:09:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.60,0:09:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.64,0:09:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,See you, Suzu and Nae!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.73,0:09:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.86,0:10:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's head back ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.03,0:10:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I need to find the parts Christina asked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.41,0:10:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Makise Kurisu works with SERN.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.38,0:10:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A SERN spy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.26,0:10:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.56,0:10:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Nullpo...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.27,0:10:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,...Gah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.48,0:10:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just sneak up on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.15,0:10:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's against the rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.78,0:10:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you were posting on @channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.99,0:10:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I had already realized you were a channer a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.86,0:10:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I wasn't, really...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.49,0:10:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.45,0:10:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point in hiding it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.74,0:10:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This sucks...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.25,0:10:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.16,0:10:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.16,0:10:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I officially give you the title of channer...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.37,0:11:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give me any more weird nicknames!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.84,0:11:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And please, keep this a secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.96,0:11:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.42,0:11:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You could list it on your résumé.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.88,0:11:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If they knew a serious academic was posting,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.09,0:11:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,they'd probably make a few threads about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.10,0:11:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I care?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.39,0:11:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what? You'd sage them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.85,0:11:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate myself for understanding that last sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.36,0:11:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.23,0:11:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.86,0:11:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,someone who's so terrible at hiding things
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.57,0:11:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,as a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.53,0:11:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.49,0:11:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The part-time warrior said you were a SERN spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.04,0:11:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.79,0:11:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.42,0:11:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.67,0:11:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You're an agent the Organization sent
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.05,0:11:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,who's had a change of heart and now works as my assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.55,0:11:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.63,0:11:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So how's the work going?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.55,0:11:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Work?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.81,0:11:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The time leap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.06,0:11:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I bought all the parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.89,0:11:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.27,0:12:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I should make it, shouldn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.94,0:12:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.57,0:12:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.98,0:12:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're getting scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.32,0:12:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That too...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.20,0:12:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I keep asking myself what'll happen if we really make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.37,0:12:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But more than that...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.91,0:12:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.20,0:12:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I should tell you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.25,0:12:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like it's half-obvious already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.71,0:12:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do it here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.59,0:12:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go somewhere I can't see your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.89,0:12:34.90,op trans,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.47,0:12:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a problem with my dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.56,0:12:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So your father was struck by lightning
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.35,0:12:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,on the grassy plains of Arkansas and fell to the dark side—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.44,0:12:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're going to be a jerk, I'm not telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.52,0:12:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.48,0:12:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,To put it simply, my dad doesn't like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.16,0:12:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No... He hates me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.16,0:12:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And not as his daughter. As a scientist, as a rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.25,0:13:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,My dad was a physicist.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.42,0:13:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I always liked hearing him
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.29,0:13:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,talk about the details of his work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.59,0:13:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, by the end of elementary school,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.01,0:13:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I could understand his papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.43,0:13:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, I started writing my own papers
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.14,0:13:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,and won awards.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.56,0:13:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But I didn't care about the awards.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.02,0:13:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I loved debating with my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.11,0:13:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We exchanged papers by email,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.53,0:13:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and our debates got deeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.99,0:13:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.24,0:13:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,eventually, my dad stopped debating with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.75,0:13:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,While I enjoyed the debates,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.25,0:13:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I was also winning them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.75,0:13:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I pointed out mistakes he'd made,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.13,0:13:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and without even thinking about it, I hurt his pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.30,0:13:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My dad started taking it out on my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.85,0:13:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He lost confidence
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.81,0:14:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and began withdrawing from his academic peers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.56,0:14:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The last time I saw him,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.77,0:14:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,he said this to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.36,0:14:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,"Do you pity me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.53,0:14:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you look down on me?"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.36,0:14:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,"You're my daughter. How dare you?"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.25,0:14:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If I make a device that enables a time leap,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.29,0:14:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I think my dad might go insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.38,0:14:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Even more than before...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.75,0:14:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's why you're hesitant to make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.55,0:14:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.13,0:14:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll end up doing it, regardless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.22,0:14:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like you said, I love experimenting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.56,0:14:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If I see a possibility, I have to investigate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.69,0:14:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like my dad used to...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.11,0:14:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The time I spent with my dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.19,0:14:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,...was like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.12,0:15:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we begin Operation Verthandi immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.50,0:15:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time to waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.13,0:15:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The Organization stands at our very doorstep!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.09,0:15:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your response?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.72,0:15:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.09,0:15:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Hououin Kyouma.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.80,0:15:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my destiny to change the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.85,0:15:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have said anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.48,0:15:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll help you reconcile with your dad too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.94,0:15:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.69,0:15:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,H-He's in Aomori.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.90,0:15:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll need money to go...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.57,0:15:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,When you work out the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.69,0:15:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,tell me as soon as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.70,0:15:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't mean you'll go with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.45,0:15:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.87,0:15:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you in peak mental condition, so you can further my ambitions!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.66,0:15:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Hououin Kyouma, shall accompany you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.21,0:15:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,and I shall use my masterful people skills
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.54,0:15:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,to reunite father and daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.38,0:15:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.13,0:16:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a self-proclaimed mad scientist, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.09,0:16:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Since when do mad scientists have people skills?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.80,0:16:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, um, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.39,0:16:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.19,0:16:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes you're a good guy, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.81,0:16:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.86,0:16:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you understand my greatness, get back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.24,0:16:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.15,0:16:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Just so we're clear, this is now decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.53,0:16:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to drag you with me, whether you want to go or not!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.08,0:16:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.67,0:16:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.75,0:16:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with all this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.42,0:16:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you call that Okarin guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.05,0:16:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.60,0:16:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.85,0:16:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the label!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.35,0:16:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It says "Makise" right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.56,0:16:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It reads "Makise pudding."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.15,0:16:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just a brand name,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.23,0:16:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,like Morinaga pudding or Koiwai pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.23,0:16:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't play stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.53,0:17:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's "Makise," anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.32,0:17:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my name!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.57,0:17:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,"Christina Makise"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.53,0:17:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If only you'd written "Christina" instead,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.49,0:17:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have accidentally ingested the extra calories.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.41,0:17:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't eat other people's food!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.25,0:17:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's my spoon! Don't use it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.38,0:17:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You use the lab's forks, don't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.55,0:17:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.97,0:17:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What's all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.34,0:17:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii's cosplay materials and sleepover set!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.81,0:17:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sleepover?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.43,0:17:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.56,0:17:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to make some cosplay outfits for ComiMa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.94,0:17:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.15,0:17:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What about your parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.15,0:17:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I told them about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.02,0:17:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're staying over too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.90,0:17:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,To work on the PhoneWave?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.28,0:17:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I thought I might.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.53,0:17:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's kind of depressing to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.08,0:17:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's this Hououin something guy
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.54,0:17:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,who goes around eating other people's pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.46,0:17:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Hououin Kyouma!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.17,0:17:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Learn my name, already!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.42,0:17:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the last person I want to hear that from!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.83,0:17:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't ignore the part about the pudding!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.96,0:18:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.76,0:18:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'll stay,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.22,0:18:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,but if I do, then Okabe should leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.93,0:18:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.51,0:18:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The lab is the house of my soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.22,0:18:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never leave—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.73,0:18:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is her condition for staying that I go shopping?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.36,0:18:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.44,0:18:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been running errands for my assistant since yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.78,0:18:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Christina?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.20,0:18:28.95,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\fry10\be5\fs50\frz13.943\move(912,710.6,912,175.8,0,2750)}Assistant
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.20,0:18:28.95,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\fry1\be5\fs30\bord0\frz14.31\move(892.5,763.399,892.5,225.799,0,2750)}I demand compensation and an apology
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.96,0:18:28.95,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\fry1\fs45\be5\an7\frz14.47\move(672,1200,672,808.5,0,1990)}I demand two puddings, \Nas punishment for the one you ate.\NAnd... \NWe're taking a late bus to Aomori, \Ndue to finances.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.79,0:18:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,"What are you so happy about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.66,0:18:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget your role as a lab mem."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.00,0:18:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not happy, stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.05,0:18:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.13,0:18:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.01,0:18:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get in before Okabe gets back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.34,0:18:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.60,0:18:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My assistant again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.90,0:19:00.19,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\pos(612,769.5)\frz14.75\blur1.125}You know too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.19,0:19:03.40,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\fs149\blur7.5\b0\move(687,720,297,720,0,3195)}You\hknow\htoo\hmuch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.70,0:19:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.88,0:19:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.26,0:19:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.47,0:19:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.61,0:20:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forgive you! Ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.90,0:20:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin, Mayushii is very sad and very embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.74,0:20:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.16,0:20:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only did you peep on us in the shower, you forgot all the shopping!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.58,0:20:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.29,0:20:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Okabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.29,0:20:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.25,0:20:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Daru!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.51,0:20:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.46,0:20:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here so late?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.18,0:20:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.97,0:20:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,When I accessed it remotely,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.64,0:20:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought there was something weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.93,0:20:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.35,0:21:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The lab is connected directly to the heart of SERN.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.48,0:21:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,SERN?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.61,0:21:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You've taken over their system?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.48,0:21:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess so. I win the Internet!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.19,0:21:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Or so I'd like to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.99,0:21:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,but to be honest, I was connected before I even knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.16,0:21:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,SERN's been standing naked outside my house
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.74,0:21:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.78,0:21:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Say what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.54,0:21:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.04,0:21:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're connected, without having done anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.58,0:21:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't that imply that they've found us out
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.25,0:21:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and are connecting to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.13,0:21:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... But I don't think I've made any errors that would've gotten us caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.43,0:21:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Now we can use the LHC all we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.76,0:21:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It can't be...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.64,0:21:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,SERN!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.10,0:21:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The LHC?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.06,0:21:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.73,0:21:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong with your phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.61,0:21:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.66,0:21:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
